      "ChannelTitle": "Kanishk Nishar",
      "Description": "Chinese conductor Elim Chan was the first ever female winner of the Donatella Flick Conduction Competition. In the Royal Concertgebouw of Amsterdam she leads the Rotterdam Philharmonic Orchestra through Rimsky-Korsakov\u0027s oriental fairytale \u0027Sheherazade Op. 35\u0027.\n\nThe musicians:\nRotterdam Philharmonic Orchestra\nElim Chan [conductor]\n\nThe musical program:\nRimsky-Korsakov: Sheherazade Op. 35\n\nRecording: The Sunday Morning Concert of Sunday the 20th of January 2019, live in The Concertgebouw in Amsterdam.\n\nMeer AVROTROS Klassiek:\n\u266C Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/AVROTROS.Klassiek/\n\u266C Twitter: https://twitter.com/klassiekonline\n\u266C Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/avrotrosklassiek/",
